{"id": "EUVD-2026-96597", "enisaUuid": "3ed47bf0-9791-3f88-a91a-54a5b1551554", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the SysTenantController queryTenantAuthInfo handler that allows any authenticated user to read other tenants' records. Low-privileged attackers can iterate small integer tenant ids to retrieve full sys_tenant records, including house numbers used as tenant join codes and company profile fields.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:44", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T02:37:45", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_tenant_ownership_and_pack_approval.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-module-system/jeecg-system-biz/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/system/controller/SysTenantController.java#L870-L874", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-sys-tenant-querytenantauthinfo"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rghv-h578-vgg2", "CVE-2026-108658"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.19, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "062aad08-ae94-364f-a675-fec8fd4c0c88", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "21eb0037-6275-3953-b549-57cf5a9e3a3d", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}